# Project: Cartoon UI Interaction Concept

This project is a UI interaction exploration focused on scrolling behavior and content transitions, inspired by familiar animated characters.

#Key Focus Areas

Scroll-based layout structure

Clip content and overflow handling

Section-based content presentation

Smart Animate for smooth transitions

What this project represents

This is a design-first approach to understanding how modern web interfaces behave before implementation. The goal is to bridge the gap between UI design and frontend development.

# Tools & Skills

Figma (UI design & prototyping)

UI/UX fundamentals

Layout hierarchy & interaction design

